1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,060
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 18=

12
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,640
So you've run off here to
live in comfort, huh?

13
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:47,280
I'll send you and that demon
to the underworld right now.

14
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,080
(You heartless son!)

15
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:56,640
A ghost!

16
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,640
Get over here!

17
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,560
You actually broke free
of the gu worm's hold

18
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,680
and woke up on your own?

19
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,040
Please save my child.

20
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,080
Okay.

21
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:27,280
Do you want to
kill our child that badly?

22
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,040
What's in your belly

23
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,360
is a ghost!

24
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,520
No!

25
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,280
It's my child!

26
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,320
I heard her.

27
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,480
She's the one talking.

28
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:37,960
Zhao Qing,

29
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,920
why should our child

30
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:42,080
pay for your sins?

31
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,480
What did he do?

32
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:45,960
Tell me.

33
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,200
Only then

34
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,880
can I save your child.

35
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:50,200
Shut up!

36
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,080
You mustn't tell!

37
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,160
I can't hide it anymore.

38
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:00,360
It was him.

39
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,040
He abandoned his own mother.

40
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,200
He left my mother-in-law
deep in the mountains

41
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,640
to starve to death.

42
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,360
(Half a Month Ago)
My son!

43
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,360
Don't leave me behind!

44
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:14,580
(Zhao Qing's Mother)

45
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,200
You've been living off me for years.

46
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,160
Now you're sick and costing me money.

47
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,840
Why don't you just die already?

48
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,280
My son,

49
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,680
I am your own mother!

50
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,640
You're my mother,

51
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,280
so you shouldn't be a burden to me!

52
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,080
My son!

53
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,560
Let go, you old hag!

54
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:35,000
My son!

55
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:37,000
My son!

56
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:40,760
Where's Mother?

57
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,640
I haven't seen her in two days.

58
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,600
Didn't you take her to see a physician?

59
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,160
She's a grown woman.

60
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,960
Why do you care so much?

61
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,000
Mother is old.

62
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,000
Her legs are weak,

63
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,160
and now she's sick.

64
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,040
What if she falls somewhere outside?

65
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:54,960
What then?

66
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,720
Go bring her back!

67
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,600
Where am I supposed to find her?

68
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,640
What?

69
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,360
She's your own mother!

70
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,440
How can you not care at all?

71
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,600
Exactly.

72
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,280
She's my mother, not yours.

73
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,000
Why are you worrying for nothing?

74
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:11,640
Go lie down.

75
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,480
Don't hurt my son.

76
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,480
Where on earth did Mother go?

77
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,240
I took her up the mountain.

78
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,400
She walked slowly,

79
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,520
so I came back first.

80
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,560
What?

81
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:24,600
How could you do something so monstrous?

82
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,960
Mother!

83
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,280
Mother, where are you? Mother!

84
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,000
Mother!

85
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,480
Go take your revenge.

86
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,080
Mother!

87
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,840
Mother!

88
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,600
Mother! What happened to you? Mother!

89
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,960
Zhao Qing...

90
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,840
He broke...

91
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,600
my legs.

92
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,080
How could he do such a thing?

93
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,600
I'm taking you home.

94
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,320
Mother, let me take you home.

95
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,160
I'm taking you home.

96
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,440
Mother!

97
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,880
Mother!

98
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,160
For the child's sake,
I didn't dare speak out.

99
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:18,400
I could only leave Mother's body
in the wilderness.

100
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,640
Zhao Qing!

101
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,000
She was your own mother!

102
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,200
How could you do such a thing?

103
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,680
She was useless anyway.

104
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,280
She should've died sooner.

105
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,320
My child is about to be born.

106
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,320
There's no money to treat her illness.

107
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,080
(I regret it!)

108
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,200
(I regret it!)

109
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,120
I heard it clearly.

110
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,560
It's Mother's voice.

111
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,080
She's in my belly.

112
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,360
It must be that man in white

113
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,200
who used shamanic arts on your mother,

114
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,840
attaching her resentment

115
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,080
to the child in your belly.

116
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,280
Then...

117
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,400
Then how can I put
Mother's resentment to rest?

118
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,640
Miss Chu Li,

119
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,600
I beg you,

120
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,280
please save my child!

121
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:16,600
Mother,

122
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,480
I'm sorry.

123
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,360
I'm sorry, Mother.

124
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,680
I beg you,

125
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,240
save me!

126
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,960
My head hurts so much!

127
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,360
Keep kowtowing.

128
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,160
I'm sorry. I'm truly sorry!

129
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,280
Save me!

130
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,560
Save me! Save me!

131
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,000
Save...

132
00:06:58,960 --> 00:06:59,720
He's dead.

133
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,560
Dying was too easy for him.

134
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,320
My belly hurts so much.

135
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:07,400
Is the baby coming?

136
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,720
For her child's sake,

137
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,440
Mrs. Zhao actually broke free
of the gu worm's hold.

138
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,480
A mother's love

139
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:49,840
is truly awe-inspiring.

140
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,160
Yes.

141
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,960
In this world,

142
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,480
some mothers love their children deeply.

143
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,080
But there are also

144
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,880
mothers who don't.

145
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,920
Thank you, Diviner Song and Miss Chu Li,

146
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,360
for saving my daughter's life.

147
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,800
Your determination got you through it.

148
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:17,960
Otherwise,

149
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,480
we couldn't have saved you either.

150
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,960
Still, thank you both.

151
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,360
Mrs. Zhao,

152
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,360
what are your plans now?

153
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,200
I plan

154
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,520
to return to my family home in Yan City.

155
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,840
Then set off soon.

156
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,280
And this is...

157
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:37,600
Mrs. Zhao,

158
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,600
this is Fusheng.

159
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,400
He's like a little brother to me.

160
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:41,640
Greetings, Mrs. Zhao.

161
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,400
Where did you go?

162
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,280
Just out having fun.

163
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,840
You never bring me along anyway.

164
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,880
Why would we bring you?

165
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:57,640
I...

166
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,640
Is everything arranged?

167
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,360
Yes.

168
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,640
We've already spread the word

169
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:09,560
about the coming natural disaster
throughout the city.

170
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,880
Some people have already
left Jinan City.

171
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,280
But

172
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,040
many still don't believe it.

173
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,800
If it were you,

174
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,160
would you believe it?

175
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:19,600
I...

176
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,600
I only trust you, Master.

177
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,800
Shiqi,

178
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,880
you and Chu Li will both
leave Jinan City.

179
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,600
Guard Chu Li for me.

180
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,000
Remember,

181
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,080
she must stay safe.

182
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,840
Go.

183
00:10:19,940 --> 00:10:23,340
(6 Days Before the City Falls)

184
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,400
(Let it all end)

185
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:38,960
(at its most beautiful moment.)

186
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:30,090
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

187
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:37,310
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

188
00:11:37,310 --> 00:11:40,890
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

189
00:11:40,890 --> 00:11:44,240
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

190
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,400
From this moment on,

191
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,800
we are husband and wife.

192
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,400
One heart between us.

193
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:54,960
If I live,

194
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,240
you live.

195
00:11:58,580 --> 00:12:05,300
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

196
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:08,840
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

197
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:12,190
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

198
00:12:12,190 --> 00:12:16,640
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

199
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,680
(Song Ziyuan,)

200
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,760
(this time, let me protect you.)

201
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,080
Why leave so early?

202
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:30,080
Chu Li is still asleep in the carriage.

203
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,080
I was afraid she couldn't bear to leave.

204
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,000
Just go.

205
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,800
(Song Ziyuan,)

206
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,560
(you have to stay alive.)

207
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,280
(As for the rest,)

208
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,440
(let me do it.)

209
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:19,620
(4 Days Before the City Falls)

210
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,720
(If I can't stop that disaster,)

211
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,880
(at least I can stop one person first.)

212
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:13,040
Song Ziyuan?

213
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,320
You're back again.

214
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,680
What do you mean?

215
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,080
What exactly are you?

216
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:24,000
What am I?

217
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,800
Don't you know already?

218
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,360
So it really is you.

219
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:37,960
What,

220
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,600
you want to team up with Yaohua
against me again now?

221
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,520
She's still alive?

222
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,120
What are you saying?

223
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,160
You don't know?

224
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,680
You're not Song Ziyuan.

225
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,280
You're Chu Li.

226
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:16,300
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

227
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:23,380
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

228
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:27,080
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

229
00:15:27,250 --> 00:15:30,450
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

230
00:15:30,770 --> 00:15:37,430
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

231
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:44,510
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

232
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:51,170
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

233
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:54,770
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

234
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:58,240
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

235
00:15:58,280 --> 00:16:05,160
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

236
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:09,050
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

237
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:12,770
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

238
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:19,610
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

239
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:55,180
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

240
00:16:55,440 --> 00:17:01,730
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
